  "faq": [
    {
      "q": "How do I use a coupon code from Clipupp?",
      "a": "Tap Show code. We copy the code for you. Open the store, add items to your cart, paste the code in the coupon or promo box at checkout, and the discount applies before you pay."
    },
    {
      "q": "Why did my code not work?",
      "a": "Most failures come from the minimum order value, a category exclusion, or a code meant for new users. Each coupon lists its conditions. If it still fails, tap No under “Did this code work?” and we re-check it within the hour."
    },
    {
      "q": "Can I use a coupon and a bank offer together?",
      "a": "Usually yes. Store coupons reduce the cart price, and bank offers apply when you pay with an eligible card. The bank offers section shows which banks stack with each store."
    },
    {
      "q": "Are the Amazon and Flipkart prices live?",
      "a": "Deal prices come from the stores’ own product feeds and refresh every few minutes. The final price is always the one shown at the store’s checkout."
    },
    {
      "q": "Is Clipupp free?",
      "a": "Yes. There is no sign-up, wallet or fee. We earn a commission from some stores when you shop through our links. It never changes your price."
    }
  ],
